1
00:00:24,359 --> 00:00:24,960
What are you up to?

2
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,000
Checking the case files.

3
00:00:26,320 --> 00:00:27,120
Writing a case summary.

4
00:00:30,800 --> 00:00:32,320
Director Zhou wants to see you.

5
00:00:36,359 --> 00:00:37,439
An informant reported

6
00:00:38,079 --> 00:00:39,759
that Hall Master Lian of the Sanshan Gang

7
00:00:40,200 --> 00:00:41,479
intercepted a shipment of arms.

8
00:00:42,079 --> 00:00:42,679
Is that so?

9
00:00:45,799 --> 00:00:46,960
These weapons

10
00:00:47,320 --> 00:00:48,600
pose a grave threat to Rongcheng.

11
00:00:49,079 --> 00:00:51,119
We can't let the Sanshan Gang keep them.

12
00:00:52,560 --> 00:00:54,240
In the name of the Rongcheng Police,

13
00:00:54,399 --> 00:00:55,640
to maintain public order,

14
00:00:56,159 --> 00:00:57,840
bring those weapons back.

15
00:00:58,719 --> 00:01:00,000
What if the Sanshan Gang refuses?

16
00:01:01,039 --> 00:01:02,079
The stakes are too high.

17
00:01:02,079 --> 00:01:03,320
He doesn't get a say in this.

18
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:16,840
Captain Xu, I've been waiting for you.

19
00:01:17,760 --> 00:01:18,640
I heard that

20
00:01:19,519 --> 00:01:21,359
Lian Ye intercepted ten thousand rifles,

21
00:01:21,799 --> 00:01:22,920
plus countless rounds of ammo.

22
00:01:23,920 --> 00:01:24,879
Is that true?

23
00:01:26,599 --> 00:01:27,280
It's not.

24
00:01:28,480 --> 00:01:29,319
What do you mean?

25
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:33,680
But the thousand rifles are real.

26
00:01:38,640 --> 00:01:40,319
This shipment appeared out of nowhere.

27
00:01:41,319 --> 00:01:42,920
The Japanese are definitely involved.

28
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:44,439
Right now,

29
00:01:45,159 --> 00:01:46,959
the police, the Shipboard Guild,

30
00:01:47,560 --> 00:01:48,879
and the Japanese all want it.

31
00:01:49,560 --> 00:01:50,840
If it falls back into Japanese hands,

32
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:55,680
disaster will strike Rongcheng.

33
00:01:56,480 --> 00:01:57,239
Don't worry.

34
00:01:58,120 --> 00:01:59,480
Lian Ye might not be one of us,

35
00:02:00,359 --> 00:02:02,959
but he knows right from wrong when it counts.

36
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,959
Over a thousand rifles...

37
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:12,000
If our brothers had gear like that,

38
00:02:13,039 --> 00:02:14,319
think of how many Japanese devils we could kill!

39
00:02:15,520 --> 00:02:16,599
It's not out of the question.

40
00:02:18,120 --> 00:02:18,919
I'll see what I can do.

41
00:02:28,159 --> 00:02:28,960
Vice Gang Leader Yan,

42
00:02:29,439 --> 00:02:30,039
Hall Masters,

43
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:31,680
what can I do for you?

44
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,879
Step aside. We're going in.

45
00:02:34,639 --> 00:02:35,280
Brother Lian said

46
00:02:35,680 --> 00:02:37,360
no one goes in except him.

47
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:38,479
I'm the Vice Gang Leader.

48
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:39,400
He's only a Hall Master.

49
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:41,240
Do you take orders from me or him?

50
00:02:41,599 --> 00:02:43,680
Brother Lian said no entry, so no one enters.

51
00:02:44,599 --> 00:02:45,520
How dare you defy me!

52
00:02:49,080 --> 00:02:49,719
Uncle Yan.

53
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,240
If you need something, come to me.

54
00:02:53,439 --> 00:02:54,360
Don't give Dali a hard time.

55
00:02:58,080 --> 00:02:59,719
You've brought quite a crowd today.

56
00:03:00,319 --> 00:03:02,120
Uncle Yan, what brings you to me?

57
00:03:02,719 --> 00:03:03,919
Stop playing dumb.

58
00:03:04,919 --> 00:03:06,879
Did you intercept a shipment of arms?

59
00:03:06,879 --> 00:03:07,520
Arms?

60
00:03:09,240 --> 00:03:10,000
Of course not.

61
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:12,960
The news is all over Rongcheng!

62
00:03:12,960 --> 00:03:14,039
Still denying it?

63
00:03:14,319 --> 00:03:16,400
Exactly, we've all heard!

64
00:03:17,120 --> 00:03:19,000
Those are just baseless rumors.

65
00:03:19,080 --> 00:03:20,199
In this warehouse,

66
00:03:20,199 --> 00:03:21,960
I'm just storing some

67
00:03:21,960 --> 00:03:23,240
Mid-Autumn Festival gifts for fishermen.

68
00:03:24,080 --> 00:03:25,439
Whether that's true or false,

69
00:03:25,719 --> 00:03:27,280
we'll see once we go in and check.

70
00:03:27,599 --> 00:03:28,199
Uncle Yan.

71
00:03:28,879 --> 00:03:31,919
Whether it's arms or gifts in there,

72
00:03:32,639 --> 00:03:34,120
that's my own business.

73
00:03:35,159 --> 00:03:36,199
It has nothing to do with you, does it?

74
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,319
It concerns the Sanshan Gang,

75
00:03:38,560 --> 00:03:39,879
so it concerns me.

76
00:03:40,599 --> 00:03:42,000
If this arms shipment is real,

77
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,759
it must be turned over to the police!

78
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:45,159
A man may be blameless,

79
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:45,960
but holding treasure invites disaster!

80
00:03:46,879 --> 00:03:48,560
Storing that stuff in our Sanshan Gang

81
00:03:49,039 --> 00:03:50,800
is like planting a ticking bomb!

82
00:03:51,280 --> 00:03:52,879
If you want to die, that's on you.

83
00:03:53,639 --> 00:03:55,680
Don't drag the Sanshan Gang down with you!

84
00:03:55,919 --> 00:03:57,199
What's all this commotion?

85
00:03:57,199 --> 00:03:58,240
Everyone's crowded around here.

86
00:03:59,800 --> 00:04:01,120
Gang Leader! Gang Leader!

87
00:04:01,120 --> 00:04:02,039
You're here just in time.

88
00:04:02,560 --> 00:04:04,599
Lian Ye brought forbidden goods

89
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:05,639
into the Sanshan Gang!

90
00:04:06,199 --> 00:04:08,159
How do you want to handle this?

91
00:04:10,159 --> 00:04:12,159
They're just Mid-Autumn Festival gifts.

92
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:14,199
I told Lian Ye to store them there.

93
00:04:14,439 --> 00:04:15,680
It's no big deal.

94
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:18,319
But Gang Leader, the rumors are everywhere!

95
00:04:18,600 --> 00:04:19,319
Enough.

96
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,800
It's all baseless nonsense.

97
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,519
We must protect our own people.

98
00:04:24,879 --> 00:04:26,240
Don't listen to outsiders' gossip.

99
00:04:26,759 --> 00:04:28,959
Since the Gang Leader has spoken,

100
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:31,439
I have nothing more to say.

101
00:04:31,959 --> 00:04:34,759
Then we'd best pray for ourselves.

102
00:04:43,399 --> 00:04:44,120
Thank you, Gang Leader.

103
00:04:44,639 --> 00:04:46,040
Pulling a tiger's whiskers...

104
00:04:46,319 --> 00:04:47,759
You've got more guts than I had back then.

105
00:04:48,480 --> 00:04:50,319
Decided how to use that shipment?

106
00:04:51,480 --> 00:04:52,079
Yes, I have.

107
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,399
You're a promising talent.

108
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:57,879
The Sanshan Gang has a worthy successor.

109
00:05:05,639 --> 00:05:07,959
Brother Lian, police are blocking the door.

110
00:05:07,959 --> 00:05:08,920
They're demanding something from you.

111
00:05:09,319 --> 00:05:11,199
Shipboard Guild's Chairman Sun sent word.

112
00:05:11,360 --> 00:05:12,680
Inviting you for a drink at Jasmine Club.

113
00:05:14,079 --> 00:05:14,680
You may go.

114
00:05:14,839 --> 00:05:15,399
Yes, sir.

115
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:17,759
Here's the plan.

116
00:05:18,199 --> 00:05:19,480
You head out the front door.

117
00:05:19,959 --> 00:05:20,480
I'll take the back.

118
00:05:25,120 --> 00:05:25,759
Captain Li.

119
00:05:26,360 --> 00:05:27,120
Brother Lian says...

120
00:05:27,519 --> 00:05:28,120
...he's not here.

121
00:05:28,319 --> 00:05:29,759
Nor does he have what you're looking for.

122
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:31,040
Take care now, I won't see you out.

123
00:05:35,639 --> 00:05:36,399
Leaving already?

124
00:05:37,240 --> 00:05:38,040
Not going to ask more questions?

125
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:41,240
He said not to waste your time, Captain Li.

126
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,279
Brother Lian.

127
00:05:45,839 --> 00:05:46,800
I've heard so much about you.

128
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:50,040
I've always wanted to drink with you.

129
00:05:52,319 --> 00:05:52,879
Cheers.

130
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,920
You're too kind, Chairman Sun.

131
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:00,360
I'm just an ordinary nobody.

132
00:06:01,360 --> 00:06:02,720
Hardly worth your notice.

133
00:06:06,199 --> 00:06:07,759
You're far too modest, Brother Lian.

134
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,519
After that warehouse blast...

135
00:06:11,920 --> 00:06:13,279
...in all of Rongcheng...

136
00:06:13,959 --> 00:06:16,040
...who doesn't know the name Lian Ye?

137
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:18,680
What did you just mention, Chairman Sun?

138
00:06:19,319 --> 00:06:19,879
An explosion?

139
00:06:21,399 --> 00:06:22,319
What explosion?

140
00:06:22,439 --> 00:06:23,120
How come I've never heard of it?

141
00:06:25,879 --> 00:06:27,560
Still playing dumb, are we?

142
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,240
Lian Ye.

143
00:06:30,759 --> 00:06:31,680
Name your price.

144
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,600
I want all of those goods.

145
00:06:35,319 --> 00:06:35,959
Chairman Sun.

146
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:37,519
To be completely honest...

147
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,040
...if I really had them...

148
00:06:40,720 --> 00:06:41,680
...I wouldn't take a dime.

149
00:06:41,680 --> 00:06:42,360
I'd just give them to you.

150
00:06:43,199 --> 00:06:46,040
But I truly don't have them.

151
00:06:46,639 --> 00:06:48,920
Even for thousands of silver dollars...

152
00:06:49,120 --> 00:06:49,680
...there's no way...

153
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:52,000
...I could hand them over, could I?

154
00:06:56,519 --> 00:06:57,480
Brother Lian...

155
00:06:58,279 --> 00:06:59,920
It seems this wine of mine...

156
00:07:01,439 --> 00:07:02,959
...isn't quite to your taste.

157
00:07:05,839 --> 00:07:06,920
Tea is tea...

158
00:07:08,240 --> 00:07:09,040
...and wine is wine.

159
00:07:11,120 --> 00:07:12,240
The flavor they leave...

160
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:16,120
...is completely different.

161
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,240
Farewell.

162
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,040
Young man.

163
00:07:28,480 --> 00:07:29,560
What's there to fret about?

164
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:31,199
Everyone wants good things.

165
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:32,680
Keeping them in your hands is dangerous.

166
00:07:36,240 --> 00:07:37,759
Old Sun sure moved fast.

167
00:07:38,120 --> 00:07:38,720
Old Sun?

168
00:07:49,120 --> 00:07:49,959
We have to find a way

169
00:07:50,480 --> 00:07:51,360
so he can't kill us.

170
00:07:52,800 --> 00:07:54,079
Unless it's no longer in your hands.

171
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:54,839
Duh.

172
00:07:58,160 --> 00:08:00,279
Dali, you're as stupid as you are clever.

173
00:08:01,639 --> 00:08:02,120
Come here.

174
00:08:05,879 --> 00:08:07,240
All right, I'll spread the word.

175
00:08:07,639 --> 00:08:08,079
Let's go.

176
00:08:31,199 --> 00:08:33,639
Folks, I'm leaving this in your hands.

177
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,519
Except to me, Lian Ye,

178
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:37,240
don't give it to anyone.

179
00:08:46,679 --> 00:08:47,480
I'll head back now.

180
00:08:51,679 --> 00:08:52,840
Hurry, get inside.

181
00:09:03,519 --> 00:09:04,159
Boss, here.

182
00:09:04,639 --> 00:09:05,159
Take care.

183
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,039
Officer, want a bowl?

184
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:07,960
Boss.

185
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:11,559
Harboring contraband of unknown origin

186
00:09:11,559 --> 00:09:12,519
is a crime.

187
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:14,159
Hope you'll turn it over to the police.

188
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:15,679
What did you say?

189
00:09:15,679 --> 00:09:16,639
If you're not eating, get lost.

190
00:09:20,759 --> 00:09:21,279
Boss.

191
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,720
I'll give you 50 silver dollars

192
00:09:24,000 --> 00:09:25,200
for what's in your hands.

193
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:26,679
Rouyan isn't that expensive.

194
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,080
A bowl is only one dollar.

195
00:09:35,639 --> 00:09:36,200
Boss.

196
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:37,600
I'm Brother Lian's man.

197
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:39,600
He sent me for the Mid-Autumn gifts.

198
00:09:40,279 --> 00:09:41,440
Brother Lian's man? Deal.

199
00:09:57,200 --> 00:09:58,960
Boss, this isn't right.

200
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:00,320
Where are the guns?

201
00:10:00,559 --> 00:10:01,919
Guns? What guns?

202
00:10:02,279 --> 00:10:03,080
I don't have anything like that.

203
00:10:03,559 --> 00:10:04,360
If you don't want to eat,

204
00:10:04,919 --> 00:10:05,639
next!

205
00:10:07,519 --> 00:10:08,480
Boss, give me a bowl.

206
00:10:10,440 --> 00:10:10,919
Coming right up!

207
00:10:12,639 --> 00:10:13,639
Boss, one bowl!

208
00:10:15,279 --> 00:10:15,919
Next!

209
00:10:22,240 --> 00:10:22,720
Chairman.

210
00:10:23,120 --> 00:10:24,519
Lian Ye is highly respected by the people.

211
00:10:24,720 --> 00:10:25,679
They only listen to him.

212
00:10:25,919 --> 00:10:26,919
The police, our men,

213
00:10:27,240 --> 00:10:28,720
even the Sanshan Gang's own people...

214
00:10:28,720 --> 00:10:29,919
None of them can sway the people.

215
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:30,799
Now, aside from him,

216
00:10:30,960 --> 00:10:31,879
no one can get the guns

217
00:10:31,879 --> 00:10:33,480
out of thousands of households.

218
00:10:34,639 --> 00:10:35,600
Useless fools!

219
00:10:35,960 --> 00:10:36,399
Get out!

220
00:10:36,679 --> 00:10:37,159
Yes, sir.

221
00:10:40,720 --> 00:10:42,080
What a clever move to scatter them.

222
00:10:43,000 --> 00:10:44,759
He gave himself a protective shield.

223
00:10:45,159 --> 00:10:46,399
Now nobody can kill him.

224
00:10:47,440 --> 00:10:49,759
Killing him makes enemies of the people.

225
00:10:50,159 --> 00:10:50,960
Mr. Matsui,

226
00:10:51,440 --> 00:10:52,080
rest assured.

227
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,600
Even if we have to fight the Sanshan Gang,

228
00:10:55,120 --> 00:10:56,279
I will get those guns back.

229
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,759
Strike the snake at its vital spot.

230
00:11:00,600 --> 00:11:01,720
I already have a plan.

231
00:11:03,879 --> 00:11:05,159
Do you have any idea who I am?

232
00:11:05,480 --> 00:11:07,360
I'm Hu Xiaoshan's daughter, Sanshan Gang!

233
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:08,519
Let me go!

234
00:11:08,879 --> 00:11:09,799
If you dare touch me,

235
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,799
you're crossing the entire Sanshan Gang!

236
00:11:12,840 --> 00:11:13,559
Let me go!

237
00:11:23,559 --> 00:11:24,879
Who was so blind

238
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:26,519
to dare lock this lady up here?

239
00:11:27,519 --> 00:11:29,120
My father will never let you off!

240
00:11:29,399 --> 00:11:30,919
Let me out, did you hear me?!

241
00:11:31,159 --> 00:11:31,919
Somebody!

242
00:11:42,440 --> 00:11:43,200
Kid.

243
00:11:44,360 --> 00:11:45,759
Do you know where you are?

244
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:51,919
Kid.

245
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:53,879
What's your name?

246
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,320
Whose kid are you?

247
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:21,480
Slow down. Take your time.

248
00:12:21,480 --> 00:12:22,120
There's plenty more.

249
00:12:53,720 --> 00:12:54,720
What made you change your mind?

250
00:12:56,159 --> 00:12:56,919
Can't bear to see me die?

251
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,399
Scoundrels live forever.

252
00:12:59,759 --> 00:13:00,799
When are you giving me the goods?

253
00:13:02,200 --> 00:13:03,320
I'll definitely give you the arms.

254
00:13:03,840 --> 00:13:04,759
But before that,

255
00:13:05,840 --> 00:13:06,919
I have to get rid of someone first.

256
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:10,480
I need to get rid of someone too.

257
00:13:20,320 --> 00:13:21,000
Who?

258
00:13:21,559 --> 00:13:22,399
Who did this?

259
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,639
Who did it doesn't matter.

260
00:13:34,759 --> 00:13:35,679
What matters is,

261
00:13:36,840 --> 00:13:38,679
to every question I ask next,

262
00:13:39,799 --> 00:13:41,759
you must answer truthfully.

263
00:13:42,960 --> 00:13:44,320
If you lie,

264
00:13:45,720 --> 00:13:46,440
then I'll...

265
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:46,960
Brother Lian,

266
00:13:47,919 --> 00:13:49,840
I couldn't collect the debt today.

267
00:13:53,519 --> 00:13:54,480
Useless trash.

268
00:13:55,759 --> 00:13:56,279
Brother Lian,

269
00:13:56,320 --> 00:13:57,759
wh-what do you mean by this?

270
00:14:26,159 --> 00:14:26,759
I'll talk!

271
00:14:27,639 --> 00:14:28,240
I'll talk!

272
00:14:28,919 --> 00:14:29,559
Sir,

273
00:14:30,639 --> 00:14:31,679
please just ask!

274
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,240
Two years ago,

275
00:14:35,000 --> 00:14:38,080
Former Chamber head Lian Shanquan crashed.

276
00:14:38,799 --> 00:14:40,240
Half an hour before the crash,

277
00:14:42,399 --> 00:14:44,120
did he stop by your repair shop?

278
00:14:44,759 --> 00:14:45,360
Yes.

279
00:14:46,440 --> 00:14:47,279
They came by.

280
00:14:48,039 --> 00:14:49,559
The cause of the crash...

281
00:14:50,919 --> 00:14:52,320
brake failure.

282
00:14:54,200 --> 00:14:56,240
Did you tamper with the car?

283
00:14:57,639 --> 00:14:58,120
I...

284
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:00,879
I did it.

285
00:15:01,799 --> 00:15:03,840
But I didn't want to kill anyone!

286
00:15:04,320 --> 00:15:05,320
I was forced into it!

287
00:15:05,960 --> 00:15:08,039
A Japanese Ronin forced me to do it!

288
00:15:08,840 --> 00:15:11,440
I had no grudge against the Lians!

289
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,600
I had no reason to kill them!

290
00:15:16,320 --> 00:15:17,759
If you don't want to die, fine.

291
00:15:20,559 --> 00:15:22,559
A portrait of that Japanese Ronin—

292
00:15:23,600 --> 00:15:24,600
draw it for me.

293
00:15:25,960 --> 00:15:26,679
I'll draw it!

294
00:15:27,879 --> 00:15:28,399
I'll draw it!

295
00:15:42,080 --> 00:15:42,879
Look into someone for me.

296
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:43,799
He's

297
00:15:44,519 --> 00:15:45,879
who ordered Old Ding at the repair shop

298
00:15:46,639 --> 00:15:48,879
to tamper with my parents' car.

299
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:51,360
I want everything on him.

300
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:57,480
Don't worry.

301
00:15:58,320 --> 00:16:00,240
Even if I turn the city upside down,

302
00:16:02,720 --> 00:16:04,519
I'll find him for you.

303
00:16:06,720 --> 00:16:07,240
Brother Lian!

304
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:08,919
Brother Lian, something terrible happened!

305
00:16:09,200 --> 00:16:10,200
Miss Hu was kidnapped!

306
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:19,559
I knew those arms would bring trouble.

307
00:16:19,879 --> 00:16:20,759
What a shame.

308
00:16:21,120 --> 00:16:22,960
Poor Baozhu has to suffer for it.

309
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:24,240
Gang Leader.

310
00:16:25,200 --> 00:16:25,639
Gang Leader.

311
00:16:30,200 --> 00:16:31,679
The kidnappers' demand is simple:

312
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:34,440
trade your shipment for Baozhu's life.

313
00:16:34,559 --> 00:16:36,440
In the end, it's still about that cargo.

314
00:16:37,519 --> 00:16:38,279
Rest assured, Gang Leader.

315
00:16:39,159 --> 00:16:40,159
This started because of me.

316
00:16:40,799 --> 00:16:42,279
I'll definitely bring Baozhu back.

317
00:16:42,480 --> 00:16:43,039
Good.

318
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:45,440
I'll compensate you for the goods later.

319
00:16:45,600 --> 00:16:46,519
I don't need any compensation.

320
00:16:47,399 --> 00:16:48,559
This was my responsibility all along.

321
00:16:49,240 --> 00:16:50,480
Dali, let's go.

322
00:17:07,559 --> 00:17:08,400
Brother Lian's things,

323
00:17:08,559 --> 00:17:09,759
we've kept them safe and sound.

324
00:17:21,319 --> 00:17:21,960
What do you want?

325
00:17:22,279 --> 00:17:22,640
What are you—

326
00:17:23,000 --> 00:17:23,519
Let go of me!

327
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:24,519
Let me go!

328
00:17:24,640 --> 00:17:25,480
Let go of me!

329
00:17:25,519 --> 00:17:25,880
Move!

330
00:17:40,319 --> 00:17:40,920
Come on.

331
00:17:51,240 --> 00:17:52,480
I've brought you the stuff.

332
00:17:53,359 --> 00:17:54,160
Where's Miss Hu?
